  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia South Asia Transmission Project (CASA1000) Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The higher level objective of the MDTF is to support implementation of the CASA-1000 project.  The Trust Fund specific development objective is to improve service delivery to communities living along the CASA-1000 corridor and support effective implementation of the CASA-1000 project, including strengthening the transmission infrastructure in Kyrgyz Republic and Tajikistan.</narrative>
  </description>
